  "$aliases_comment": "aliases + bareMatch + visibility feed .claude/scripts/resolve.mjs. A bareMatch repo routes from its bare name in a prompt; every other repo needs an explicit form (in X, X repo, ~/X, databayt/X), one of its aliases, or its name right before one of its own blocks (food kitchen). Aliases must be unambiguous — Arabic مكان/سوق/شفاء are everyday words (place/market/healing), so they are NOT aliases; a production domain is always safe (it never matches inside a longer host name). visibility: \"private\" keeps a repo and its blocks off the public page (content/docs/places.mdx); the local index still routes it."
